WEBVTT

00:00.310 --> 00:04.230
<b>Episode 6: Nursing with Him</b>

00:05.850 --> 00:07.590
<i>Looks: A+!</i>

00:06.400 --> 00:08.070
<b>Looks A+</b>

00:09.260 --> 00:11.070
<i>Body: A+!</i>

00:09.610 --> 00:11.070
<b>Body A+</b>

00:12.500 --> 00:14.390
<i>Personality: A+!</i>

00:13.570 --> 00:14.910
<b>Personality A+
(On the outside)</b>

00:15.390 --> 00:18.830
<i>Mona Kawai, seventeen years old. 
Osaka born and bred.</i>

00:19.330 --> 00:22.760
<i>A girl who charms as easily as she breathes.</i>

00:22.760 --> 00:24.580
<i>It's been a year since I moved to Tokyo.</i>

00:28.980 --> 00:32.330
<i>And in my high school life, 
it's me for the win!</i>

01:00.440 --> 01:00.860
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

01:00.440 --> 01:00.860
<b>Medaka!</b>

01:01.110 --> 01:01.860
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

01:01.110 --> 01:01.860
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

01:01.110 --> 01:01.860
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

01:01.110 --> 01:01.860
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

01:57.290 --> 02:03.970
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

01:57.290 --> 02:03.970
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:04.540 --> 02:05.480
Morning.

02:05.480 --> 02:06.230
Morning.

02:08.830 --> 02:11.280
Kuroiwa-kun isn't in today?

02:11.280 --> 02:14.190
I don't think I've seen Medaka-kun 
take a day off before.

02:14.190 --> 02:17.780
He has a cold. We had P.E. for 
6th period yesterday, remember?

02:18.670 --> 02:22.210
Apparently, he left all his stuff 
and ran home in his gym uniform.

02:22.210 --> 02:23.550
Why'd he do that?

02:23.550 --> 02:26.730
The chill from the rain must've done him in.

02:26.730 --> 02:28.870
What is wrong with him?

02:32.070 --> 02:35.630
Do... Do you dislike smaller sizes?

02:38.130 --> 02:43.800
<i>Asahi Shonan... 
I didn't expect she'd be so daring.</i>

02:44.330 --> 02:46.720
<i>But if getting wet in the rain did him in...</i>

02:47.040 --> 02:50.060
We got pretty wet, all told.

02:50.360 --> 02:54.440
<i>Maybe it was sharing an umbrella 
with me that got him sick?</i>

02:54.440 --> 02:57.320
How about we check on him on the way home?

02:58.400 --> 03:03.890
What? A girl would be one thing, 
but I don't wanna go visit a sick dude.

03:03.890 --> 03:07.370
Listen, Medaka-kun lives alone. 
What if he's collapsed or something?

03:07.370 --> 03:10.080
You've got a point there.

03:18.900 --> 03:23.470
It might be my fault that 
Kuroiwa-senpai got sick.

03:23.470 --> 03:25.180
Better go check on him, then.

03:25.180 --> 03:25.850
Huh?

03:26.460 --> 03:29.350
Practice is off since the tourney ended, right?

03:29.350 --> 03:32.190
W-Well, yeah, I do have time...

03:32.190 --> 03:34.360
This is the stuff dreams are made of.

03:34.670 --> 03:35.780
Right?

03:36.230 --> 03:38.230
Gotta love cosplay.

03:38.740 --> 03:40.900
What's there to love?

03:40.900 --> 03:43.980
You get to see them in a new light, I guess?

03:43.980 --> 03:48.040
I mean, you look great in your basketball gear.

03:48.040 --> 03:49.500
Uh-huh...

03:50.330 --> 03:54.500
You might be able to see Kuroiwa-senpai 
in his PJs if you go visit.

03:59.590 --> 04:03.800
Living alone must be great. 
He can meditate 24/7 if he wants.

04:03.800 --> 04:07.400
I know his family runs a temple, but come on.

04:09.270 --> 04:10.810
<i>Mwahaha.</i>

04:11.100 --> 04:15.690
<i>I'll tail them to his place and 
make my move once they leave.</i>

04:15.690 --> 04:18.550
<i>Just you wait, Medaka.</i>

04:20.800 --> 04:22.050
This was it, right?

04:22.050 --> 04:24.030
Hope he's still alive.

04:26.280 --> 04:29.110
<i>So this is where Medaka lives.</i>

04:29.830 --> 04:33.300
<i>Hey, this might be my first time 
visitin' a boy's home.</i>

04:33.300 --> 04:36.320
Oh, this must be Kuroiwa-senpai's 
apartment building.

04:39.240 --> 04:42.360
Asa—I mean, Shonan-san?

04:42.360 --> 04:43.130
Heya.

04:43.130 --> 04:46.140
Fancy running into you here. 
Do you live nearby?

04:46.760 --> 04:49.010
Nah, I'm here to check on Kuroiwa-senpai.

04:51.210 --> 04:54.090
Wh-What about basketball practice?

04:54.090 --> 04:55.480
Today's an off day.

04:55.860 --> 04:59.570
You said you two aren't dating, 
so you shouldn't have a problem, right?

05:00.000 --> 05:02.540
I... I don't, but...

05:02.540 --> 05:03.820
<i>This girl!</i>

05:03.820 --> 05:05.420
<i>Sh-She's serious!</i>

05:05.420 --> 05:07.880
<i>She's serious about takin' me on!</i>

05:08.200 --> 05:13.330
Still gonna claim you don't like him when 
you're following people to get his address?

05:13.330 --> 05:15.580
What? That again?

05:15.870 --> 05:20.290
<i>Who knows what she'll do if she 
gets into Medaka's place with me?!</i>

05:20.290 --> 05:22.010
Good to see you're doing okay.

05:22.010 --> 05:23.760
Be a good boy and get some rest.

05:23.760 --> 05:24.970
I will.

05:37.800 --> 05:39.240
What? You forget some—

05:43.700 --> 05:45.060
Here I am.

05:45.870 --> 05:47.950
<i>M... Mona-chan?!</i>

05:47.950 --> 05:50.890
H-How do you know where I live?

05:50.890 --> 05:52.080
That's a secret.

05:52.610 --> 05:54.910
H-Hello.

05:55.660 --> 05:56.960
<i>The basketball girl, too.</i>

05:57.440 --> 06:01.200
<i>Kuroiwa-senpai looks great 
in roomwear as well!</i>

06:01.540 --> 06:03.240
So, what's up?

06:03.240 --> 06:06.920
I heard you live alone, 
so I came to check on you.

06:07.560 --> 06:10.680
Mind if I come in? 
I brought you a bunch of stuff.

06:11.160 --> 06:15.640
<i>Oh, crap, I've never had girls over in my life!</i>

06:15.640 --> 06:19.540
<i>They know I live alone, right? 
Do they have no inhibitions?!</i>

06:19.540 --> 06:21.650
<i>City girls are so daring!</i>

06:24.370 --> 06:25.730
Kuroiwa-senpai!

06:25.730 --> 06:28.090
I-I know you came to check on me and all,

06:28.090 --> 06:30.280
but I'll be fine by myself.

06:30.280 --> 06:32.160
You can leave...

06:42.860 --> 06:46.960
I can't leave you alone when 
you're running such a high fever.

06:48.600 --> 06:50.220
U-Uh, this is a different thing...

06:52.970 --> 06:55.120
I'll nurse you back to health.

06:55.600 --> 06:58.980
<i>I'll prove that nobody in this world 
is more charming than me!</i>

06:58.980 --> 07:00.790
Excuse me.

07:01.250 --> 07:02.730
A-And me.

07:02.730 --> 07:05.610
<i>Not that I care about Medaka!</i>

07:05.610 --> 07:08.640
<i>Not that I like him or anything!</i>

07:09.110 --> 07:11.450
<i>But the only one he's allowed to fall for...</i>

07:11.450 --> 07:13.200
<i>is me!</i>

07:20.750 --> 07:26.130
<i>So this is what Medaka's place is like. 
It kinda smells of soap.</i>

07:28.400 --> 07:30.970
<i>That's his bed, huh?</i>

07:32.140 --> 07:33.970
K-Kuroiwa-senpai.

07:35.140 --> 07:39.670
Please lie down. Have some of this to hydrate.

07:39.670 --> 07:41.480
Th-Thank you.

07:41.810 --> 07:44.590
Do you mind if I use your kitchen?

07:45.110 --> 07:47.310
I'll make you some porridge.

07:47.310 --> 07:49.690
A-And I'll cut you some 
bunny-shaped apple slices.

07:57.830 --> 07:59.290
Hang on!

07:59.680 --> 08:03.290
You need to learn how to hold a knife first.

08:05.570 --> 08:06.760
Whoa.

08:07.130 --> 08:10.200
<i>I needed her help for almost everything.</i>

08:10.200 --> 08:12.130
<i>I gotta go on the attack!</i>

08:12.520 --> 08:16.190
<i>Th-This is wearing me out mentally.</i>

08:16.190 --> 08:19.500
<i>But this is where the real nursing begins!</i>

08:19.500 --> 08:21.890
Let me feed you.

08:21.890 --> 08:24.020
N-Nah, I can eat by myself!

08:24.020 --> 08:26.610
<b>Cooling
Plasters</b>

08:24.020 --> 08:26.610
H-Here's a cooling sheet!

08:27.770 --> 08:29.160
I'll put one on, too.

08:29.580 --> 08:31.530
How does that feel, Kuroiwa-kun?

08:32.320 --> 08:36.280
I don't know if I'm hot or cold anymore.

08:36.980 --> 08:39.700
<i>You've got game, Asahi Shonan!</i>

08:39.700 --> 08:44.460
<i>But I'm gonna destroy you and put 
you out of the running for good!</i>

08:46.430 --> 08:47.750
Kuroiwa-kun!

08:56.300 --> 08:58.780
Wh-What?!

09:01.570 --> 09:04.800
Let's take your temperature, shall we?

09:05.480 --> 09:06.780
Wait...

09:06.780 --> 09:10.900
<i>Booyah! I got this from the drama club! 
Behold your Nightingale!</i>

09:10.900 --> 09:14.560
<i>Asahi can't hope to match this!</i>

09:14.560 --> 09:15.260
Hey.

09:17.090 --> 09:20.730
If you brought a thermometer, 
you should've used it earlier.

09:22.160 --> 09:22.950
Wha...

09:22.950 --> 09:26.160
<i>Sh-She grabbed the doctor's outfit 
I'd brought as a spare!</i>

09:26.160 --> 09:29.960
<i>Ask for permission, girl! 
And wait, was that the better choice?!</i>

09:33.690 --> 09:37.220
L-L-Let me examine you with a stethoscope.

09:39.220 --> 09:42.830
<i>I can't believe she'd be willing to grab 
someone else's costume to win.</i>

09:42.830 --> 09:44.470
<i>She's got guts!</i>

09:45.300 --> 09:46.790
<i>But I won't lose!</i>

09:45.300 --> 09:46.790
<i>I won't lose!</i>

09:51.600 --> 09:53.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

09:56.610 --> 09:58.990
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

10:03.420 --> 10:06.170
Kuroiwa-senpai's gone to sleep.

10:06.170 --> 10:09.500
Yeah. Let's let him rest.

10:09.840 --> 10:14.800
<i>I honestly didn't expect you to 
put up such a fight, Asahi Shonan.</i>

10:15.560 --> 10:17.800
You're pretty tough.

10:18.100 --> 10:20.580
Huh? What do you mean?

10:20.580 --> 10:22.800
<i>And she just refuses to drop it.</i>

10:23.340 --> 10:25.310
B... Brr...

10:26.550 --> 10:27.690
<i>Sorry.</i>

10:29.560 --> 10:32.690
By the way, Asahi Shonan...

10:32.690 --> 10:34.480
Quit talking like that. It's weird.

10:34.780 --> 10:35.870
<i>Scary.</i>

10:35.870 --> 10:39.250
What? I'm just talking like I always do.

10:39.250 --> 10:43.910
Anyway, have you stopped getting 
nervous around Kuroiwa-kun now?

10:43.910 --> 10:45.540
L-Lay off me!

10:48.360 --> 10:54.210
I'm not completely over it yet, 
but it's different when there's competition.

10:54.210 --> 10:57.800
Why do you try so hard, anyway?

10:59.250 --> 11:01.290
Because I like him.

11:04.340 --> 11:05.810
That's all?

11:06.460 --> 11:12.130
<i>She can try so hard going up against me, 
the queen bee, just because she likes him?</i>

11:12.440 --> 11:14.600
What do you mean, "that's all"?

11:14.600 --> 11:18.820
I like him, so I wanna go out with him, 
hold hands and stuff...

11:19.260 --> 11:23.070
M-Maybe even kiss...

11:24.570 --> 11:27.950
Gah, what am I even saying 
to you of all people?!

11:28.340 --> 11:30.520
I'll go buy some drinks.

11:30.520 --> 11:34.720
Don't get any funny ideas and 
jump on him just because I'm gone.

11:36.890 --> 11:38.340
<i>Why would I?</i>

11:41.640 --> 11:46.350
<i>I don't care about an asleep Medaka. 
I can't put any moves on him.</i>

11:51.020 --> 11:52.470
Because I like him.

12:01.070 --> 12:04.070
<i>Is that what love does to people?</i>

12:08.590 --> 12:09.700
Y-You're up?

12:10.170 --> 12:11.160
How do you feel?

12:21.340 --> 12:24.340
It was love at first sight! 
I felt a zing run through me!

12:24.650 --> 12:25.410
Was it his face?

12:25.410 --> 12:28.140
Dunno. Just his overall aura?

12:28.140 --> 12:30.720
But I just know this has to be fate!

12:30.720 --> 12:34.980
A fated union? That's so romantic.

12:35.310 --> 12:38.300
How? I bet she's exaggerating.

12:38.300 --> 12:40.410
Love at first sight is such a stupid concept.

12:43.650 --> 12:45.490
<b>Math I</b>

13:08.890 --> 13:12.750
<i>Man, I used to be such a 
love-at-first-sight denier.</i>

13:12.750 --> 13:17.150
<i>Now look at me, hanging out 
at the very same guy's place.</i>

13:17.470 --> 13:20.090
<i>That stuff earlier was so embarrassing.</i>

13:20.090 --> 13:22.150
<i>Playing doctor felt like too much.</i>

13:24.490 --> 13:25.280
K...

13:25.660 --> 13:27.020
Kuroiwa-kun?

13:27.360 --> 13:29.360
<i>Wh-What's goin' on?!</i>

13:29.360 --> 13:30.430
Why?

13:30.430 --> 13:31.790
Zzz...

13:31.790 --> 13:33.050
Z?

13:33.050 --> 13:36.960
Who's a good Tama? Your fur's so soft.

13:36.960 --> 13:39.710
<i>He's asleep! He's talkin' in his sleep!</i>

13:39.710 --> 13:43.710
Come on, don't startle me like that.

13:44.200 --> 13:46.050
<i>Just sleep.</i>

13:46.980 --> 13:49.050
<i>Maybe even kiss...</i>

14:13.550 --> 14:15.500
<i>What was I thinking?</i>

14:15.990 --> 14:17.860
<i>Something's wrong with me!</i>

14:23.770 --> 14:26.160
I knew it! You <i>did</i> jump on him in bed!

14:26.160 --> 14:27.420
I don't believe you!

14:27.420 --> 14:29.630
W-Wait! You've got it all wrong.

14:29.630 --> 14:32.140
Ugh... Quiet.

14:36.500 --> 14:38.500
I knew you couldn't be trusted!

14:38.500 --> 14:41.530
You were clinging to him yesterday, 
and now you tried to kiss him!

14:41.530 --> 14:43.020
I wasn't, and I didn't!

14:43.020 --> 14:45.400
You said you were just friends, 
but you're all lies!

14:45.740 --> 14:50.780
You can't expect that to fly 
when you looked so in love just now!

14:51.830 --> 14:54.030
Wh-What are you saying?

14:54.300 --> 14:56.420
<i>"So in love," my foot!</i>

14:56.420 --> 14:58.290
<i>Medaka will be the one madly in love with me!</i>

14:58.590 --> 15:02.080
<i>Besides, I was just spacing out earlier.</i>

15:02.080 --> 15:04.090
<i>It ain't like I tried to kiss him.</i>

15:04.090 --> 15:06.340
<i>I mean, if I did, that'd mean...</i>

15:06.340 --> 15:07.960
I knew it all along.

15:08.340 --> 15:09.720
<i>That'd mean I...</i>

15:09.980 --> 15:12.390
You really <i>do</i> like Kuroiwa-senpai!

15:12.390 --> 15:13.850
<i>Li...?</i>

15:13.850 --> 15:18.350
No! I'm just tryin' to make him 
fall for me 'cause he just refuses to!

15:19.660 --> 15:20.730
Huh?

15:20.730 --> 15:24.980
I keep tryin' all sorts of things, 
but he just refuses to!

15:27.780 --> 15:29.520
I said nothing.

15:29.520 --> 15:31.780
Nothing at all.

15:33.030 --> 15:34.800
Are you listening?

15:35.940 --> 15:37.290
Hello?

15:37.640 --> 15:41.380
<i>Mona-senpai's the most popular girl 
in school. Everyone loves her.</i>

15:41.380 --> 15:45.290
<i>But because Kuroiwa-senpai's different, 
she's trying to get him to succumb to her?</i>

15:45.290 --> 15:48.060
<i>No, it definitely looked 
like she was into him.</i>

15:48.060 --> 15:51.310
<i>But I don't think she's lying right now...</i>

15:51.310 --> 15:52.470
<i>Wait.</i>

15:53.720 --> 15:57.930
<i>Has this girl not realized how she feels?</i>

15:57.930 --> 15:59.930
<i>That's so stupid. What the heck?</i>

16:00.100 --> 16:01.690
<b>Math I</b>

16:04.560 --> 16:08.260
<i>But it did start out 
in a stupid way for me too...</i>

16:14.420 --> 16:15.740
Let's go back in.

16:15.740 --> 16:19.340
And we'll leave when Senpai's fever goes down.

16:19.970 --> 16:24.040
Don't worry. I won't tell anyone. 
That way, we're even.

16:25.380 --> 16:28.760
She may not realize it, 
but she does like the same guy I do.

16:29.390 --> 16:32.090
<i>Oh, what am I gonna do with her?</i>

16:32.730 --> 16:35.040
I swear I won't lose.

16:48.940 --> 16:52.030
<b></b>Get well soon <3

16:48.940 --> 16:52.030
<b></b>Mona <3

16:48.940 --> 16:52.030
<b></b>Rest well

16:48.940 --> 16:52.030
<b></b>Asahi

16:57.580 --> 16:58.560
Morning.

16:58.560 --> 17:00.090
Awfully cold today.

17:00.490 --> 17:03.830
"I hope Kuroiwa-kun comes to school today.

17:03.830 --> 17:06.020
I wonder if he got better.

17:06.020 --> 17:08.520
I wanna see him back and healthy again.

17:08.520 --> 17:11.090
I'm so worried, it's ripping my heart apart."

17:11.090 --> 17:14.520
It's too early for this, Shonan-san. 
What are you trying to pull?

17:14.520 --> 17:17.520
I'm just speaking out your thoughts for you.

17:17.520 --> 17:18.250
Wha?

17:18.250 --> 17:22.220
Also, "I wanna see Kuroiwa-senpai 
if he shows up."

17:22.610 --> 17:26.400
<i>Peeking in from the door 
was all you could manage before,</i>

17:26.400 --> 17:29.820
<i>but now you're trying to get in my head, 
are you, Asahi Shonan?</i>

17:30.430 --> 17:33.020
Also, just call me Asahi. No honorific.

17:33.020 --> 17:35.820
I bet you do that mentally already.

17:35.820 --> 17:38.700
<i>This is getting complicated.</i>

17:35.820 --> 17:40.490
<b>Bingo...</b>

17:38.700 --> 17:40.490
<i>But I'm not dropping the act.</i>

17:40.870 --> 17:45.290
<b>Sparkle <3</b>

17:40.880 --> 17:41.820
Asahi!

17:41.820 --> 17:44.320
Drop the sparkle. It's obnoxious.

17:44.320 --> 17:46.210
Morning, Mona-chan.

17:46.510 --> 17:48.640
Huh? It's Shonan-san.

17:48.640 --> 17:49.540
Heya.

17:49.540 --> 17:51.410
What're you doing in a second-year classroom?

17:51.410 --> 17:53.530
She's friends with Mona-chan.

17:53.530 --> 17:54.430
Right?

17:54.430 --> 17:55.550
Uh, well...

17:55.980 --> 17:59.550
We even went to check on 
Kuroiwa-senpai together yesterday.

18:00.530 --> 18:01.550
Hey!

18:01.550 --> 18:02.530
Huh?

18:02.530 --> 18:04.140
We went too.

18:04.140 --> 18:06.560
You knew where Medaka-kun lived, Mona-chan?

18:07.190 --> 18:08.770
J-Just by chance.

18:08.770 --> 18:12.990
And I somehow ran into Asahi 
passing by, also by chance.

18:12.990 --> 18:15.030
<i>This dumbass!</i>

18:15.030 --> 18:17.410
Wish I could've run into you instead.

18:17.410 --> 18:20.180
We gotta grill Medaka if he shows up.

18:20.180 --> 18:22.660
<i>This convo bothers me!</i>

18:22.660 --> 18:27.420
<i>Asahi Shonan was Mona-chan's 
rival in love, wasn't she?</i>

18:27.420 --> 18:30.920
<i>But she's gotten so friendly with 
Mona-chan in the blink of an eye!</i>

18:30.920 --> 18:36.970
<i>No fair! She hasn't even 
called me "Tsubomi" yet!</i>

18:36.970 --> 18:38.550
<i>Oh, the jealousy!</i>

18:38.940 --> 18:41.500
L-Let me in on the fun!

18:41.500 --> 18:43.690
Oh, Haruno-san! Morning!

18:43.560 --> 18:44.680
<b>"Haruno-san"</b>

18:43.690 --> 18:44.680
Ugh...

18:44.680 --> 18:46.420
<i>I won't lose!</i>

18:46.420 --> 18:48.940
<i>Why do I feel a piercing glare?</i>

18:53.190 --> 18:54.940
Medaka!

18:54.940 --> 18:56.780
Hey, are you all better now?

18:57.070 --> 19:00.170
Yeah. Thanks for checking on me yesterday.

19:00.170 --> 19:01.640
All good.

19:01.640 --> 19:03.860
We'll come hang out for real sometime.

19:03.860 --> 19:05.620
G-Good morning.

19:06.760 --> 19:07.790
Morning.

19:10.290 --> 19:11.750
I knew it all along.

19:11.750 --> 19:14.500
You really <i>do</i> like Kuroiwa-senpai!

19:14.500 --> 19:16.990
<i>Why'd I have to recall that now?</i>

19:17.460 --> 19:19.580
M-Morning.

19:19.920 --> 19:22.120
I'll see you later.

19:23.090 --> 19:25.930
<i>She really left once she saw Medaka.</i>

19:30.830 --> 19:32.810
<i>M-My face is burnin' up.</i>

19:33.300 --> 19:36.730
<i>Asahi's gotten me all tense 
and worked up now.</i>

19:37.120 --> 19:37.940
Hey...

19:37.940 --> 19:38.780
Huh?!

19:38.780 --> 19:40.920
Wh-What?

19:40.920 --> 19:42.530
<i>Settle down, girl!</i>

19:42.960 --> 19:43.960
Listen.

19:46.600 --> 19:47.530
I...

19:50.210 --> 19:54.130
S-Sorry! I'm busy looking at my 
phone right now, so tell me later!

19:54.130 --> 19:55.590
Oh, okay.

19:56.140 --> 19:56.790
<i>Wha—</i>

19:56.790 --> 20:00.600
<i>Wh-What kind of excuse was that? 
Who cares about the phone?</i>

20:00.600 --> 20:04.050
<i>And why did I stop him?</i>

20:04.050 --> 20:07.930
<i>It's not every day Medaka 
starts a conversation with me.</i>

20:07.930 --> 20:10.350
<i>But hey, I've got all day.</i>

20:10.350 --> 20:12.810
<i>I just gotta get my act together.</i>

20:12.810 --> 20:13.680
Hey...

20:13.680 --> 20:15.360
I gotta go to the staff room!

20:15.360 --> 20:17.780
<i>I did great yesterday!</i>

20:17.780 --> 20:18.650
Hey...

20:18.650 --> 20:20.990
Sorry, I'm in the middle of a convo.

20:20.990 --> 20:23.310
<i>Time to get back in the game and focus.</i>

20:23.310 --> 20:24.080
Hey.

20:24.080 --> 20:25.410
I'm so busy.

20:25.410 --> 20:27.890
<i>I can't do anythin' right!</i>

20:27.890 --> 20:29.740
<i>What is wrong with me?</i>

20:29.740 --> 20:32.540
<i>Why is just lookin' at Medaka makin' me blush?</i>

20:32.540 --> 20:34.170
<i>What's goin' on?!</i>

20:34.570 --> 20:36.010
Hey, it's Mona-chan.

20:36.010 --> 20:38.040
She even runs cute.

20:40.630 --> 20:41.800
S-Sorry.

20:43.380 --> 20:46.140
Oh, just remembered something I had to do.

20:48.790 --> 20:51.270
<i>Huh? I'm dizzy...</i>

21:04.290 --> 21:05.180
Are you up?

21:05.940 --> 21:07.460
Kuroiwa-kun?

21:10.460 --> 21:11.790
You have a fever.

21:12.690 --> 21:15.280
A fever? Who, me?

21:17.170 --> 21:18.680
Wow, I do.

21:18.680 --> 21:22.630
<i>Is this what was throwin' me off all day?</i>

21:22.910 --> 21:25.210
The nurse will be back soon.

21:25.930 --> 21:28.550
I'll go back to class.

21:28.810 --> 21:30.330
Th-Thanks.

21:30.330 --> 21:33.210
Did you carry me here?

21:34.310 --> 21:38.060
I mean, it might be my fault you're sick.

21:41.620 --> 21:44.030
Thanks for coming to see me yesterday.

21:46.950 --> 21:49.980
Th-That's all I wanted to say.

21:49.980 --> 21:51.560
S-Sure.

21:56.340 --> 21:58.510
<i>He's so earnest.</i>

21:58.510 --> 22:00.920
<i>Wait, carried me?</i>

22:01.500 --> 22:02.480
<i>Like this?</i>

22:03.570 --> 22:04.560
<i>Like this?!</i>

22:05.460 --> 22:06.920
<i>Or could it be...</i>

22:08.570 --> 22:10.370
<i>This is the fever talkin'!</i>

22:10.370 --> 22:15.020
<i>It ain't about Medaka! 
It's just the fever talkin'!</i>

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
<b>Episode 7





Lockscreen with Him</b>

23:46.970 --> 23:50.030
Next time: "Lockscreen with Him."
